  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — first stable release; tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.0.0 in lockstep. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for the 1.x line. Recommended public-key path: X25519 + ML-KEM-768 hybrid combiner with multi-recipient support, fully managed via BouncyCastle (no platform ML-KEM dependency, runs anywhere .NET 10 does). Same library code as 1.0.0-rc.3 — no format, public-API, or runtime-dependency change. Suite-versioning lockstep with the core is enforced by the release workflow. EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.3 baseline. See CHANGELOG.md.",
